<title>USA: Crescent completes $148 mln placement.</title>
<headline>Crescent completes $148 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crescent Real Estate Equities Co said Tuesday it has completed a private placement of 4.7 million shares of common stock, valued  at $148 million, with an affiliate of the Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>Crescent also said that during a preliminary term of one year Crescent will have the opportunity to execute a share settlement with UBS based on the then market price of its common stock.  Alternatively, Crescent may complete the settlement for cash.</p>
<p>Crescent is a fully-integrated real estate company which owns 72 office and six retail properties,  92 behavioral healthcare facilities, six hotels, and interests in four residential development corporations.</p>
</text>
